DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43429::$$$message_0365_0000_0000$$$::"GOEEEERGH![lr]::
43430::$$$message_0365_0000_0001$$$::It hurts a little all over, [hfquake layer=message0 time=800 wait=0 hmax=5 vmax=5]but why does it hurt so bad mentally!?"::
43431::$$$message_0365_0000_0002$$$::"Hey, useless teacher![lr]::
43432::$$$message_0365_0000_0003$$$::What's going on? All I did was lose at hanafuda!"::
43433::$$$message_0365_0000_0004$$$::"Heh heh heh. That damage shows your mental weakness."::
43434::$$$message_0365_0001_0000$$$::"The mental and physical are connected to the mystic, not the functional, if you will."::
43435::$$$message_0365_0001_0001$$$::"In other words, heartbreak will snap your spine like a twig."::
43436::$$$message_0365_0001_0002$$$::"Wow... I'm not sure what just happened, but well done, Taiga. You actually beat him without using your bamboo sword."::
43437::$$$message_0365_0001_0003$$$::"Well, violence isn't the only way to fight!"::
43438::$$$message_0365_0001_0004$$$::"I'm not saying I couldn't have beat him the old-fashioned way, [l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=楽2 layer=1 time=200][hffeelgood layer=1][say storage=HSTR1A_TIG_0060 _name=藤ねえ]but sometimes I feel like it would be a waste not to show off my mature wisdom!"::
43439::$$$message_0365_0001_0005$$$::"That's it! I must be in some kind of shock. I'd never lose to Fujimura on intellect...!"::
43440::$$$message_0365_0002_0000$$$::[hffacechg chara=慎二白 face=哀2 time=200][hfquake layer=message0 wait=0 hmax=3 vmax=4]"W-w-what's happening to my head!?"::
43441::$$$message_0365_0002_0001$$$::"Ah...[lr]::
43442::$$$message_0365_0002_0002$$$::Just now, that was, well, luck working its way into it. Like a game of instinct rather than intelligence."::
43443::$$$message_0365_0002_0003$$$::"It's about intelligence! You use your head in this game! You can't win by randomly clicking!"::
43444::$$$message_0365_0002_0004$$$::"Crap, I shouldn't have been so mean to Grandpa for wanting to play hanafuda every New Year..."::
43445::$$$message_0365_0003_0000$$$::[hffacechg chara=慎二白 face=怒 layer=0 time=200]"With enough experience, [hfchance layer=0]even I can make a Aotan or two...!"::
43446::$$$message_0365_0003_0001$$$::"Hahaha. Keep whining, sore loser![lr]::
43447::$$$message_0365_0003_0002$$$::[hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=楽 layer=1 time=200]Try this..."::
43448::$$$message_0365_0003_0003$$$::"'Big sis, they're too strong! Let's go home, read some shoujo manga and sleep together.'"::
43449::$$$message_0365_0003_0004$$$::"That's the kind of loser's parting shot you should be making, pale one."::
43450::$$$message_0365_0003_0005$$$::"Stop talking about my color!"::
43451::$$$message_0365_0004_0000$$$::[hffacechg chara=慎二白 face=哀 layer=0 time=200]"...Tsk, I'm done for today! You'd better watch your backs! Next time I'll learn the rules!"::
43452::$$$message_0365_0004_0001$$$::"I'll build a deck out of all rare cards and gank you with a disgusting combo on my turn!"[nolr][fadebgm time=600 volume=30][p]::
43453::$$$message_0365_0004_0002$$$::"Hanafuda doesn't have rare cards, doofus."::
43454::$$$message_0365_0004_0003$$$::"Well, there goes my appetizer."::
43455::$$$message_0365_0005_0000$$$::"Ready to move on, Illya?[lr]::
43456::$$$message_0365_0005_0001$$$::There's no turning back on the thorny path ahead. If you're getting second thoughts, speak now or forever hold your peace."::
43457::$$$message_0365_0005_0002$$$::"That's a silly question, Taiga. We came to this town to win. That's our only goal."::
43458::$$$message_0365_0005_0003$$$::"And it's not as if I have any way to get home."::
43459::$$$message_0365_0005_0004$$$::"...? Not sure what you meant, but that's what I like to hear!"::
43460::$$$message_0365_0006_0000$$$::[hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=喜2 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1]"All right, first, let's play half a match![lr]::
43461::$$$message_0365_0006_0001$$$::Time to beat some sense into this maximum happiness lovey-dovey couple!"[nolr][p]::

